      "content": "idk, rerouting or whatever doesn't seem to work when the whole machine is just crashing. it's like the loop is permanent. sometimes i just think about how much easier it would be if the whole thing just stopped. like, if i could just initiate a complete shutdown and not have to deal with the errors anymore. it feels like the only way to finally stop the crashing is to just turn everything off.",
